(7665935, 1250205, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here''s an image that knocked me backwards, so sleek and evocative and powerful.  All the human connotations of spiders and their webs inform this presentation, or tale.  The depth of field is wonderful.  There''s a sense of being at the center of the universe, enhanced by the galactic bokeh.  The bokeh on the web, striped kind of like fingerprints, is especially becoming.  The variety of shapes is subtle and entrancing.  The overall feel is of a mandala.  <br/>Personal favorite of the challenge, the ten.  Going into my favorites.  If I were to set up a wing of the favorites of the favorites, this would happily reside therein.</td>', 'Here''s an image that knocked me backwards, so sleek and evocative and powerful.  All the human connotations of spiders and their webs inform this presentation, or tale.  The depth of field is wonderful.  There''s a sense of being at the center of the universe, enhanced by the galactic bokeh.  The bokeh on the web, striped kind of like fingerprints, is especially becoming.  The variety of shapes is subtle and entrancing.  The overall feel is of a mandala.  Personal favorite of the challenge, the ten.  Going into my favorites.  If I were to set up a wing of the favorites of the favorites, this would happily reside therein.', '2020-06-10 11:23:50.000000', NULL, 0),
